Description: MCP server for the Subreg.cz domain registrar
 An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server exposing the Subreg.cz domain
 registrar SOAP API as tools for an LLM agent, built on fastmcp and
 python3-subreg-client.
 .
 Tools cover domain availability/info/listing, pricelists, account
 credit, DNS zone lookups, contacts, and order status (all read-only
 by default), plus domain registration/renewal/deletion, DNS record
 writes, contact writes, and credit adjustments, gated behind
 SUBREG_READONLY=false. Login credentials are read once from the
 environment at startup and are never tool parameters.
